# Contribute


## Install

We use bash-tap to write tests

```bash bash
mkdir -p t bin
curl -sL 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bas080/bash-tap/refs/heads/master/bash-tap' > ./bin/bash-tap
```

## Generate the README

```bash bash
export DIR="${DIR:-$(mktemp -d)}"
export PATH="$PWD/bin:$PATH"

mkdir -p "$DIR"

markatzea ./README.mz | tee README.md
npx markdown-toc -i README.md
```
